    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 02/16/24  6:45:11 AM: Pumped the water out with another pump and pvc line. Inspected pumps and found both of them are working just fine. When the one pump was removed and was said to be not working, the pvc was capped off. The cap came off and was causing this issue. Tied the second pump back in and tightened everything. Tested both pumps, and they are working good. | Joshua Patton - 02/12/24 11:15:26 AM: pump is working the water is draining slowly but no coming out the exit pipe have blackburn coming out to scope the pipe.",
