    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 06/23/22 10:15:52 AM: James got the contactor replaced. Tested unit and everything is working good. Sent back to shipping. | Preston Ellexson - 06/17/22  6:06:45 AM: I drove the lift around a few days trying to see what issues the lift was having. There is a spot when moving forks forward that throws an error code. It happens more when steering in certain positions. The code is -06. James @ Medley came out to test. One of the contactors is going bad. He said it should be in late tonight or Monday.",
