    "completed_datetime": "04/23/2024 01:00 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 04/24/24  7:51:23 AM: James got parts ordered for the brake cylinder leak. He ordered a new tire for the lift. He came out and pulled the tire off the down lift and put on this lift so we could get it back in production. We will stock the other one when it arrives for a backup. He swapped out the cylinder as well. Tested for leaks and drove. Lift is operating safely.",
