    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "08/02/2024 12:00 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 08/05/24 11:59:43 AM: Took James a couple trips here to get everything fine tuned. When you adjust the main speed on some, all the turning acceleration curves, and forward/reverse acceleration curves are much lower. You can adjust most of the lifts individually for each \"parameter\" after the main speed is where it needs. We  have another work order for our brand new lift to have a blue light added. James is going to do the speed adjustment when he comes back for that. I'll document it on the other work order. | Preston Ellexson - 01/25/24 10:40:35 AM: Working with the guys at Medley Equipment Company on this. I'll have to get with Heubel Shaw for the Raymond lifts.",
    "attachments": []
