    "completed_datetime": "03/06/2026 10:00 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 03/09/26 12:14:28 PM: Johnson Equipment came back out with the repaired cylinder. Bay #8 is back in use with no issues. | Preston Ellexson - 02/16/26  8:50:11 AM: Johnson Equipment Company came out. The said they can get it rebuilt and probably have it back in 4 days. If they order a new one, it'll be a much longer lead time. We are just having them rebuild it and we won't use Bay 8 until it gets fixed. I got with Agkop on this already. | Preston Ellexson - 02/12/26  7:20:22 AM: Inspected bay #8 while it was closed. Shipping was on break. Main cylinder is dry. Hoses are dry. Motor and pump are dry as well. The extend cylinder is leaking. There is oil on the bottom of it. I don't think there are any other issues, but I will go back down before lunch to have an operator run it while I inspect it closer.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "1813",
    "equipment_eq_id": "EQ ID 1813",
