    "problem": "The AC in the shipping office is not cooling.",
    "status": "Closed and Completed",
    "material_cost": "0",
    "labor_time": "2",
    "work_performed_by": "Preston/Johnson Heat & Air",
    "assigned_to": "Maintenance",
    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "09/04/2024 12:00 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 09/13/24  4:23:55 AM: Johnson Heat & Air made it out and did AC PM's on both mini splits, and the 2 old 5 tons out front. Everything is working good. | Preston Ellexson - 08/27/24 11:24:56 AM: Turned power off. Cleaned outdoor unit with water then air. Wrapped up coolant lines due to some of the insulation being melted off. I used aluminum foil tape to completely wrap the lines. I don't see anything else wrong with the indoor or outdoor unit. Johnson Heat & Air will be here 8/30 to check freon and do general maintenance if needed. | Preston Ellexson - 08/21/24  4:12:14 AM: Looking at this now.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "1813",
