    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 02/18/26  4:11:55 AM: James came out and was working on replacing this. There was a broken bolt that he couldn't get out. I tried a few ways to removed it with no luck. When we plugged the new part in, it isn't operating the lift at all. I must have damaged it when trying to remove the broken bolt. We removed the used handle assembly from the jack that is not operational. It is very worn, but working. We got it on the good jack and operational. It is ready to run. We are ordering another assembly to replace on the unit we robbed from. | Preston Ellexson - 02/09/26  7:46:42 AM: James came out and is getting the needed parts ordered. | Preston Ellexson - 02/02/26 11:58:13 AM: James will be here tomorrow to check this out. | Preston Ellexson - 01/19/26  4:20:20 AM: Left handle either fell off or broke. Shaft is still good. I think we have to order the entire assembly. Reaching out to Medley for parts.",
