    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 12/09/24  4:56:14 AM: The first service on this Shawn found the load cell for the film tension was running high on voltage. He adjusted and that fixed that issue. He worked on a few other small things while he was here. David showed up for the next issue and I documented that on another work order. Rat chewed through wires under the turntable. | Preston Ellexson - 07/08/24 10:14:09 AM: Working with tech from Veritiv on getting this issue resolved. I will check machine today and forward findings to tech.",
