    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "01/28/2025 10:30 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 02/05/25  7:05:25 AM: Shawn from Veritiv came out. Found a roller that was bound up and not sliding in and out the way it should. He repaired it and lubed it. Chain on film delivery system was dry and needed adjusted. He ran multiple pallets at all different tension levels and didn't get a break at all. He believes this was mainly due to the locked up roller. Machine is running with no issues.",
    "attachments": []
  },
