    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 03/06/25  5:39:11 AM: David came out and inspected the machine. Repaired some parts that had been removed. He worked with the operators on their issues. Gave them some useful information on the machine and the wrap material. Everything is working good now. I will monitor with shipping employees. | Preston Ellexson - 02/20/25  9:49:10 AM: Getting a PO for a technician service call. Should be able to be out next week once we get the PO sent in.",
