    "urgency": "2. General Maint - High Priority",
    "problem": "Turntable making a knocking noise when in use.",
    "status": "Closed and Completed",
    "material_cost": "0",
    "labor_time": "5",
    "work_performed_by": "Preston",
    "assigned_to": "Maintenance",
    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "08/17/2026 07:00 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 08/17/26  4:50:30 AM: Machine is not making any noises. This hasn't happened in quite awhile. The other day, it got bound up on them. When inspecting it, I didn't hear anything or see any large debris build-up. Everything is running good. | Preston Ellexson - 04/03/26 12:26:18 PM: Locked the machine out. Released belt tension. Removed the 4 bolts needed to removed the turntable, installed eyebolts, and removed the table. It was really dirty and messy underneath. Multiple roller bearings were full of wrapping. Removed pulley and cleaned wrapping from main swivel bearing. Removed tension roller and cleaned wrapping from under it. I greased the idlers underneath. Sprayed all bearings with dry lube spray. Only a couple are not fully spinning. They are still functional. I am getting a quote for replacements. Got everything put back together after cleaning. Lined up pulley in home position and put turntable top back on. Bolted all down. Set tension on the turntable belt. Unlocked machine and had Ryker run a pallet. It is running much smoother, but still making a little noise every rotation. I will get bearings and rollers ordered next week. I'll install them when they arrive and keep this open until then. | Preston Ellexson - 03/31/26  7:07:19 AM: I got tied up this morning with a tech when I arrived. I got with Karen on this. She said tomorrow morning would be a better morning to do this since I was running late today. All my tools are ready to start first thing. | Preston Ellexson - 03/30/26  8:17:26 AM: I got with Agkop on this. Had Ryker run a pallet through it. The turntable needs to be removed to inspect. More than likely just build up of wrapping or something that needs cleaned. I will do this first thing at 6 tomorrow morning before shipping arrives.",
    "attachments": []
  },
