    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 09/07/23  9:43:52 AM: Lift was dead and the chargers were off when this was originally put in. Had operator charge the lift fully, and there are no issues. | Preston Ellexson - 09/05/23  5:45:07 AM: Disconnect was off, so the lift didn't get charged this weekend. Waiting for it to fully charge, or Sammy is going to call when she needs it so I can inspect it.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "1834",
    "equipment_eq_id": "EQ ID 1834",
    "equipment_name": "Electric Forklift #2 (Raymond)",
    "department": "Shipping",
    "wo_id": "10481",
    "date_notified": "02/22/2024",
    "urgency": "5. Prod Ongoing, Maint Required",
    "problem": "Cell in battery dead, causing charge to deplete quickly",
    "status": "Closed and Completed",
    "material_cost": "0",
    "labor_time": "3",
    "work_performed_by": "Preston/Arley@Wells Industrial",
    "assigned_to": "Supervisor",
    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "02/22/2024 02:00 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 03/28/24  6:37:39 AM: Arley received the replacement cell and came out. We removed the battery, then the cell. Put new cell in. Arley welded all the terminals back in and got everything ready to install. Put battery back in the lift and tested. Everything is working good on the forklift now. Took back to Sammy in shipping. | Preston Ellexson - 02/22/24 10:29:19 AM: Got with Wells Industrial Battery. Arley came out this morning. Found a bad cell in the center that had very high specific gravity. The cell we though was dead is just dry. Bad filler cap. I had Sammy bring to fill station. We cleaned the top of the battery off and manually filled the empty cell. I am awaiting a quote to see if we can have them take our battery and swap out a bad cell or 2. Otherwise we just order a brand new battery from them.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "1834",
    "equipment_eq_id": "EQ ID 1834",
    "equipment_name": "Electric Forklift #2 (Raymond)",
    "department": "Shipping",
