    "assigned_to": "Supervisor",
    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "02/26/2024 01:00 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 03/28/24  6:34:36 AM: Got the contactor in on 3/18. Swapped out and let Johnson Heat & Air know. Ran machine but kept getting an LP error on the cooling unit. 3/20 I got in touch with the manufacturer and had one of their techs call to help with the remainder of the freon charge. Johnson Heat & Air came out and followed his prodcedure. They finally got the system fully charged with freon. We have been running good since with no more cooling unit errors. | Preston Ellexson - 02/29/24  4:06:46 AM: Got with Sammy on this. Drove the lift outside for a little while so I could hear more. I hear what it is, but doesn't sound like anything alarming. I told her to keep listening to it and let me know if it gets any louder. It sounds more like and electronic sound to me. I'll check again next week and update.",
    "attachments": []
  },
