    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 04/04/25  5:48:19 AM: We bought a small and large forklift rain guard years ago and never opened them. Took them to shipping. Large one fits the new Toyota really well. The small one will work better for the Raymond and Clark sit down forklifts. Charles has a spot to store them by the corner entrance. I let Agkop know that we need to be using them in the rain at all times.",
    "attachments": []
