    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "08/21/2024 12:00 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 08/22/24  7:30:29 AM: Got the lift back and it is working good now. They made numerous adjustments on the master cylinder for the parking brake. Lift was still a little jerky on turns. James came out yesterday and re-adjusted the turn setting for acceleration on both drive sides. Tested lift and there is no more jerking while turning. Sent back to shipping. | Preston Ellexson - 08/15/24 12:44:13 PM: James came out and found the parking brake still not function properly. In order to take the master cylinder off, you have to removed the mast and much more. Sent lift the Medley for repair. | Preston Ellexson - 08/06/24  4:05:17 AM: Inspecting lift and getting with James@Medley if needed.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "1590",
