    "assigned_to": "Maintenance",
    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "05/01/2025 09:30 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 05/01/25  7:56:42 AM: James came out with a new backup horn. Got it installed and it is working good now. It is self adjusting in volume, so when in louder areas it will beep louder, and quieter in less noisy areas. | Preston Ellexson - 04/17/25  6:19:16 AM: Backup horn needed replaced. I am going to disconnect it due to the fact that you can't hear it unless you're on the lift. James @ Medley will be here today. I'll have him order another one.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "1590",
    "equipment_eq_id": "EQ ID 1590",
    "equipment_name": "Electric Forklift #1 (Clark)",
    "department": "Shipping",
    "wo_id": "16273",
    "date_notified": "07/02/2025",
    "urgency": "4. Prod Continuing but Affected Equipment stopped",
    "problem": "Hello team,\n\nCan you please take a look at our Clark forklift. Lisa heard a \"pop\".\n\nBest,\nAgkop Baltagian",
    "status": "Closed and Completed",
    "material_cost": "0",
    "labor_time": "0.25",
    "work_performed_by": "Preston",
    "assigned_to": "Maintenance",
    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "07/14/2025 10:30 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 07/14/25  8:43:53 AM: We haven't had any more issues on this lift. | Preston Ellexson - 07/02/25  8:22:19 AM: Checked lift. There were small bare spots on the negative and positive battery cables. They were right where there is a metal bracket above it with the battery compartment shut. This could have arced out and made a popping sound. I covered the cables with electrical tape. I will monitor today and tomorrow to see if they have any more issues with this lift.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "1590",
    "equipment_eq_id": "EQ ID 1590",
    "equipment_name": "Electric Forklift #1 (Clark)",
    "department": "Shipping",
    "wo_id": "20057",
    "date_notified": "07/09/2026",
    "urgency": "6. General Maint",
    "problem": "Removal of the 2 arm rails on Clark forklift seat.",
    "status": "Closed and Completed",
    "material_cost": "0",
