    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 09/14/26  4:08:22 AM: Operator said the red light has been on for some time. It isn't taking water now and the battery level seems to get lower quicker. I put the forklift on the charger 9/4 and pulled the key. First thing 9/7 I removed it from the charge and manually filled all battery cells. The light was green when I was finished. I am going to follow-up with Charles to see how it ran last week.",
